ml_url":"https://github.com/fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","login":"fire","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire"},"body":"Asset pipeline team approved and solves the OBJ workflow where people wanted to use one mesh rather than a scene.\n\nWill need future improvement on Blendshapes  with multiple meshes. Godot Engine requires all the surfaces in the same mesh to have the same blendshapes.\n\nLOD discard is ok.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116269#pullrequestreview-3835896291","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116269","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-21T19:58:41Z"},{"id":3835896658,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7koyNS","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","login":"lyuma","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma"},"body":"I would like the comment about LOD and Blendshapes to be its own line in the documentation with a warning or note line so it's very apparent that these limitations exist.\n\nI would also suggest that we should give an error when given a blendshape mesh (LODs can be discarded safely)\n\nWe should discuss with the rendering team if there is a way to address possible performance issues of blend shapes being different on each surface","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116269#pullrequestreview-3835896658","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116269","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-02-21T19:58:47Z"}]